Package: pi-coding-agent
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
  ${shlibs:Depends},
  nodejs (>= 22),
Description: Coding agent CLI with tools and session management
 pi is a coding agent CLI (the "pi" command) with read, bash, edit, and
 write tools plus session management. This package installs the self-contained
 @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent Node module tree under
 /usr/lib/node_modules and a /usr/bin/pi launcher.
